-- =====================================================================================================
-- finaluseddbschema.sql : ProveYu database (MySQL 8, utf8mb4): schema + showcase data
-- Flyway version 49 (V1..V49 applied). 66 tables. Load into an EMPTY database and set SPRING_FLYWAY_BASELINE_VERSION=49;
-- Flyway then runs only newer migrations (V50, ...) on start. Tables of V45..V49 (Code ground, password_changed_at) are here, empty:
-- the showcase data below is unchanged.
--
-- Data (made through the app by scripts/seed_college.py and scripts/seed_ltce_years.py, with mail switched off):
--   * the 20 platform mock tests (placement test path)
--   * one college with complete data: Lokmanya Tilak College of Engineering (ltce.in), three batches:
--       Batch 2025  last season, finished: 64 students, ~70% placed, offers joined / accepted / declined, Dream and Super Dream
--       Batch 2026  current season: 70 students, completed drives with offers, one drive in interviews, upcoming drives
--       Batch 2027  pre-final year: 50 students, summer internships with pre-placement offers, an upcoming internship
--     team, 5 branches, 28 companies with contacts, 28 drives in every stage with rounds, results and interviews, offers,
--     announcements with read receipts, chat, 334 mock test attempts with proctoring flags, AI mock interviews with reports,
--     a practice test and a scheduled sessional exam, off-campus jobs and applications, support tickets, notifications
--   * the college leadership (CXO) account of LTCE
-- Not included: the platform admin (created by ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_* on the first start), the admin audit log, Flyway history,
-- verification / reset tokens, the CXO prompt log, AI answer cache and saved CXO dashboards, and uploaded files (no documents,
-- offer letters, screenshots or audio are referenced).
-- Sign-in passwords of the college accounts are NOT in this repository: they were given to the owner separately.
-- =====================================================================================================

