"text\":\"What comes next in the series: 5, 12, 26, 54, 110, ?\",\"options\":[\"225\",\"198\",\"222\",\"227\"],\"yourOption\":2,\"correctOption\":2,\"explanation\":\"Rule: multiply by 2 and add 2. Next term = 222.\",\"marksAwarded\":1,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q14\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Logical ability\",\"text\":\"What comes next: H, K, N, Q, T, ?\",\"options\":[\"Y\",\"V\",\"X\",\"W\"],\"yourOption\":0,\"correctOption\":3,\"explanation\":\"Each letter moves 3 places forward.\",\"marksAwarded\":0,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q15\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"A train 300 m long passes a pole in 18 seconds. What is its speed in km/h?\",\"options\":[\"60 km/h\",\"50/3 km/h\",\"66 km/h\",\"56 km/h\"],\"yourOption\":3,\"correctOption\":0,\"explanation\":\"300/18 m/s × 18/5 = 60 km/h.\",\"marksAwarded\":0,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q16\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"A can finish a work in 40 days and B in 10 days. In how many days will they finish it working together?\",\"options\":[\"8 days\",\"15/2 days\",\"9 days\",\"25 days\"],\"yourOption\":0,\"correctOption\":0,\"explanation\":\"Together per day: 1/40 + 1/10 = 1/8; time = 8 days.\",\"marksAwarded\":1,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q17\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"The present ages of A and B are in the ratio 5:3. After 8 years, the ratio will be 7:5. What is A\'s present age?\",\"options\":[\"20 years\",\"12 years\",\"28 years\",\"18 years\"],\"yourOption\":2,\"correctOption\":0,\"explanation\":\"Let ages be 5x and 3x. (5x+8)/(3x+8) = 7/5 gives x = 4; A = 20.\",\"marksAwarded\":0,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q18\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"A can finish a work in 24 days and B in 40 days. In how many days will they finish it working together?\",\"options\":[\"32 days\",\"16 days\",\"29/2 days\",\"15 days\"],\"yourOption\":3,\"correctOption\":3,\"explanation\":\"Together per day: 1/24 + 1/40 = 1/15; time = 15 days.\",\"marksAwarded\":1,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q19\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"In what ratio must rice at Rs 30/kg be mixed with rice at Rs 54/kg so that the mixture costs Rs 35/kg?\",\"options\":[\"30:54\",\"19:5\",\"5:19\",\"20:5\"],\"correctOption\":1,\"explanation\":\"Alligation: (cheaper : dearer) = (54 − 35) : (35 − 30) = 19:5.\",\"marksAwarded\":0,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q20\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"Two pipes can fill a tank in 8 hours and 24 hours. How long will they take to fill it together?\",\"options\":[\"6 hours\",\"7 hours\",\"11/2 hours\",\"13/2 hours\"],\"yourOption\":3,\"correctOption\":0,\"explanation\":\"Rate = 1/8 + 1/24 = 1/6; time = 6 hours.\",\"marksAwarded\":0,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q21\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"In how many ways can a committee of 3 be chosen from 7 people?\",\"options\":[\"35\",\"210\",\"42\",\"70\"],\"yourOption\":0,\"correctOption\":0,\"explanation\":\"C(7,3) = 35.\",\"marksAwarded\":1,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q22\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"If today is Wednesday, what day of the week will it be after 294 days?\",\"options\":[\"Thursday\",\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\"],\"yourOption\":0,\"correctOption\":3,\"explanation\":\"294 mod 7 = 0; Wednesday + 0 days = Wednesday.\",\"marksAwarded\":0,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q23\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"A starts a business with Rs 9000. After 6 months B joins with Rs 3000. At the end of the year the profit is Rs 1400. What is B\'s share?\",\"options\":[\"Rs 700\",\"Rs 200\",\"Rs 1200\",\"Rs 350\"],\"correctOption\":1,\"explanation\":\"Ratio = 9000×12 : 3000×6 = 108000:18000; B gets 1400 × 18000/126000 = Rs 200.\",\"marksAwarded\":0,\"marks\":1},{\"id\":\"q24\",\"type\":\"MCQ\",\"section\":\"Quantitative ability\",\"text\":\"In how many ways can a committee 